config MTK_COMBO_WIFI
	tristate "MediaTek MT6833 connectivity Wi-Fi"
	depends on ARM64
	depends on WLAN
	depends on CFG80211
	select MMC
	help
	  Build the MediaTek MT6833 connectivity stack, including the WMT
	  controller support required by the Wi-Fi driver and the AXI Wi-Fi
	  driver itself.

	  This is the in-tree form of the A22X vendor connectivity driver.
	  Selecting M builds the connectivity components as kernel modules.
